<title>USA: Fed says 3-day system RPs totaled $1.340 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says 3-day system RPs totaled $1.340 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added $1.340 billion to the banking system on Monday via three-day system repurchase agreements, the New York Fed confirmed.</p>
<p>(( --N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
